---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Work" active="work" description="Case studies and brand systems built for KodeKloud, Simplilearn, Webenza, Zolostays, and BYJU'S. Creative pipelines, YouTube growth, and production infrastructure.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl pt-28 pb-12 px-4">
    <!-- Vertical rules -->
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-4 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.06] to-transparent md:left-8"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-4 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.06] to-transparent md:right-8"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <span class="text-sm tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mb-6">Selected Work</span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display italic text-white mb-4">Case Studies</h1>
      <p class="max-w-lg text-base text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
        Brand systems, creative pipelines, and production infrastructure. Built for each company, from scratch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case Study Cards -->
  <section class="py-4 pb-24 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">

      <!-- KodeKloud -->
      <a href="/work/kodekloud" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-indigo-500/5 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display italic text-white group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">KodeKloud</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-1">Associate Creative Director · Dec 2022 – Oct 2025</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          Took over the entire marketing video operation from the CEO and CMO. Built the creative team, pipeline, and design system that scaled the YouTube channel from 125K to 300K+ subscribers.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Brand Strategy', 'YouTube Growth', 'GenAI Workflow', 'Team Leadership', 'Paid Ads', 'Data-Driven'].map(tag => (
            <span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Simplilearn -->
      <a href="/work/simplilearn" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-500/5 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display italic text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Simplilearn</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-1">Assistant Manager – Motion Graphics · Jan 2021 – Dec 2022</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          Led a team of 8 motion designers and editors. Owned the entire YouTube pipeline shipping 200 videos per quarter. Grew the channel from 500K to 2M+ subscribers.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['People Management', 'Video Production', 'YouTube Growth', 'Team Leadership', 'A/B Testing', 'Motion Graphics'].map(tag => (
            <span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Webenza -->
      <a href="/work/webenza" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-emerald-500/5 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display italic text-white group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">Webenza</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-1">Executive – Digital Media & Design · Nov 2018 – Sep 2020</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          Sole video producer for 50+ enterprise clients including Amazon, Bosch, Schneider Electric, Ola Money. Built the template system and QC process that made agency-scale production possible.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Multi-client Ops', 'Creative Ops', 'Motion Graphics', 'Storytelling', 'Template Systems'].map(tag => (
            <span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Zolostays -->
      <a href="/work/zolo" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/5 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display italic text-white group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">Zolostays</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-1">Creative Producer · Contract · Sep 2020 – Jan 2021</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          Six-month solo contract. Created every asset for the Zolo Got Talent brand campaign. Contestant videos, teasers, logo animations. From brief to publish, completely independent.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Campaign Management', 'Creative Direction', 'Video Production', 'Solo Production'].map(tag => (
            <span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- BYJU'S -->
      <a href="/work/byjus" class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-violet-500/5 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display italic text-white group-hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors">BYJU'S</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-1">Creative Associate · Aug 2017 – Oct 2018</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          First creative role out of college. Made motion graphics for K-12 STEM curriculum. Learned shape layer animation, green screen production, and how to collaborate with subject matter experts.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Motion Graphics', 'Video Editing', 'Post-Production', 'Storytelling', 'K-12 Education'].map(tag => (
            <span class="rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center border-t border-white/[0.06]">
    <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-4">Want to see the full picture?</p>
    <a href="/resume" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-300 text-sm tracking-wide">
      View Resume →
    </a>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .font-display {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
